  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R4D Sankore Project: Strengthening Innovation and Technology across West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will contribute to the broader Sankore initiative by providing support to key innovation ministries in Nigeria and Ghana around their policy / regulatory environment, structural pathways for support the commercialisation of innovations, and the establishment of a Helpdesk serving both regional FCDO staff and government partners involved in Sankore.</narrative>
  </description>
